{"title":"2009 AMC 12A Problems/Problem 10","text":"<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><dl><dd><i>The following problem is from the <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2009_AMC_12A_Problems\" title=\"2009 AMC 12A Problems\">2009 AMC 12A #10</a> and <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2009_AMC_10A_Problems\" title=\"2009 AMC 10A Problems\">2009 AMC 10A #12</a>, so those problems redirect to this page.</i></dd></dl>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Problem\">Problem</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2009_AMC_12A_Problems/Problem_10&amp;action=edit&amp;section=1\" title=\"Edit section: Problem\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>In quadrilateral <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/f/9/e/f9efaf9474c5658c4089523e2aff4e11488f8603.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$ABCD$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"60\" height=\"14\" />, <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/d/8/8/d88d3b225d4dcf1a78380f5c98940f6107e3deca.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$AB = 5$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"64\" height=\"14\" />, <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/a/d/d/add662a0bcea3258bd427832357a4d6a542bf69c.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$BC = 17$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"73\" height=\"14\" />, <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/4/d/9/4d99eb629f027ee953f4fce4c24425c6fb800a24.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$CD = 5$\" width=\"62\" height=\"12\" />, <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/6/7/9/6790c30f7e0de64cd05074a11aa915120e09ad5a.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$DA = 9$\" width=\"62\" height=\"13\" />, and <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/8/9/f/89fff82bb65d0215e49c8c91cb7c553da52205e2.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$BD$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"32\" height=\"14\" /> is an integer. What is <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/8/9/f/89fff82bb65d0215e49c8c91cb7c553da52205e2.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$BD$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"32\" height=\"14\" />?\n</p>\n<center><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/5/7/0/570b698fea7c6d66beab04dd6aee44dd24f2b6c1.png\" class=\"latexcenter\" alt=\"[asy] unitsize(4mm); defaultpen(linewidth(.8pt)+fontsize(8pt)); dotfactor=4;  pair C=(0,0), B=(17,0); pair D=intersectionpoints(Circle(C,5),Circle(B,13))[0]; pair A=intersectionpoints(Circle(D,9),Circle(B,5))[0]; pair[] dotted={A,B,C,D};  draw(D--A--B--C--D--B); dot(dotted); label(&quot;$D$&quot;,D,NW); label(&quot;$C$&quot;,C,W); label(&quot;$B$&quot;,B,E); label(&quot;$A$&quot;,A,NE); [/asy]\" width=\"358\" height=\"85\" /></center><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/f/1/c/f1c91317cfa55d222c95104286c1e90c8ee7c1bf.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\textbf{(A)}\\ 11 \\qquad \\textbf{(B)}\\ 12 \\qquad \\textbf{(C)}\\ 13 \\qquad \\textbf{(D)}\\ 14 \\qquad \\textbf{(E)}\\ 15$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"394\" height=\"17\" />\n</p><h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Solution\">Solution</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2009_AMC_12A_Problems/Problem_10&amp;action=edit&amp;section=2\" title=\"Edit section: Solution\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>By the <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=Triangle_inequality\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Triangle inequality\">triangle inequality</a> we have <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/6/0/b/60b0a18ae56f591d170e9486dc413779dc75b86a.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$BD &lt; DA + AB = 9 + 5 = 14$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"241\" height=\"14\" />, and also <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/7/4/9/74970605a1dea225a719b814cb0428018a7de99f.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$BD + CD &gt; BC$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"135\" height=\"14\" />, hence <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/8/3/c/83c2a0e0df682b1f94fd40dc2a9ef415d1b658b1.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$BD &gt; BC - CD = 17 - 5 = 12$\" style=\"vertical-align: 0px\" width=\"251\" height=\"13\" />.\n</p><p>We get that <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/3/f/a/3fa71d1c756ae190f63e4fd935de6b83c722f676.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$12 &lt; BD &lt; 14$\" style=\"vertical-align: 0px\" width=\"115\" height=\"13\" />, and as we know that <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/8/9/f/89fff82bb65d0215e49c8c91cb7c553da52205e2.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$BD$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"32\" height=\"14\" /> is an integer, we must have <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/7/a/b/7abcbbd0f931cc53b4cce01a408c4fa4a4672ca8.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$BD=\\boxed{13}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -5px\" width=\"84\" height=\"23\" />.\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"See_Also\">See Also</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2009_AMC_12A_Problems/Problem_10&amp;action=edit&amp;section=3\" title=\"Edit section: See Also\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<table class=\"wikitable\" style=\"margin:0.5em auto; font-size:95%; border:1px solid black; width:80%;\">\n<tbody><tr>\n<td style=\"background:#ccf;text-align:center;\" colspan=\"2\"><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2009_AMC_12A\" title=\"2009 AMC 12A\">2009 AMC 12A</a></b> (<b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2009_AMC_12A_Problems\" title=\"2009 AMC 12A Problems\">Problems</a></b> • <b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2009_AMC_12A_Answer_Key\" title=\"2009 AMC 12A Answer Key\">Answer Key</a></b> • <a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" href=\"http://www.artofproblemsolving.com/community/c13\">Resources</a>)\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td width=\"50%\" align=\"center\" rowspan=\"1\">Preceded&#160;by<br /><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2009_AMC_12A_Problems/Problem_9\" title=\"2009 AMC 12A Problems/Problem 9\">Problem 9</a></b>\n</td>\n<td width=\"50%\" align=